/*
 * Implements the full semantic-validation pipeline for classes.
 *
 * This module coordinates all validation phases required to fully validate
 * a class definition, including:
 *
 *   - ancestor validation,
 *   - compile-time assertions,
 *   - trait-implementation listing,
 *   - constructor validation,
 *   - method vtable construction,
 *   - field validation,
 *   - movable-constructor synthesis,
 *   - destructor validation,
 *   - typeinfo generation,
 *   - class finalization.
 *
 * Validation is recursive and supports forward references through a multi-phase
 * “precary” mechanism. Classes may be validated multiple times until all
 * dependencies are resolved. Finalization occurs once the root validation
 * completes.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *   - Emile Cadorel <emile.cadorel@davidson.fr>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2021-12-09
